{"4165310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loot Tycoon", "steam_appid": 4165310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4604960, 4599670], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/059bc42033b5ef470ac2e8ae64a0c40d.avif?t=1787218926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras_big/059bc42033b5ef470ac2e8ae64a0c40d.webp?t=1787218926 width=1560 height=537 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Tycoon is a dark fantasy idle RPG that seamlessly blends the thrill of Diablo-style looting with the satisfaction of shop management. While combat and trading are fully automated, your role is far from passive. Every decision you make shapes the unknown surprises of your journey. You must meticulously plan your character's growth and strategize the perfect synergy between your equipment and runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you risk diving deeper into the abyss to hunt for greater treasures, or will you retreat safely to secure your current earnings? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/54af4340b681ee8478d9847697f96775.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/54af4340b681ee8478d9847697f96775.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/54af4340b681ee8478d9847697f96775.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9953f6af1f6d7bc235b84980ed5525c1.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes and Equipment are far more than simple tools of war—they are the very engine of your strategy. Your choice of Runes dictates the flow of combat, while your equipment loadout maximizes your loot efficiency. With hundreds of unique effects and a boundless array of randomized affixes, you have the absolute freedom to engineer thousands of game-breaking builds. Whether you prefer a Berserker style that wipes the entire screen in a single slash, a Pyro-Maniac build that incinerates enemies with critical burns, or a Storm Controller that locks down the battlefield with lightning, every combination reflects your unique signature. Master the art of the kill, control the rhythm of destruction, and experience the perfect fusion of deep strategy and pure adrenaline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9d4b67fc6fa9f2e395045383e23e5603.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9d4b67fc6fa9f2e395045383e23e5603.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9d4b67fc6fa9f2e395045383e23e5603.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/12bc4fd75c2e8c8085e4d846edf950ac.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a dragon falls, loot rains from the sky like a storm of gold! These massive rewards are the ultimate payoff for your strategy. Every piece of loot you scavenge is a stepping stone to your fortune. Your merchandise is automatically stocked and sold—from common gear to God-tier artifacts. Watch as adventurers flock to your shop, pouring an endless stream of Gold into your pockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hoard your wealth—reinvest it! Spending is the key to growth. Use your earnings to upgrade your stats and equip higher-tier Runes; every coin spent is an investment in your future power. As your Adventure Rank rises, the challenges become deadlier, but the payouts become astronomical. Thrive in the infinite loop of looting and selling, eventually becoming the most powerful adventurer and the wealthiest tycoon in the realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/e3076a4ff528f9ffe60068d22a6c5fdd.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/e3076a4ff528f9ffe60068d22a6c5fdd.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/e3076a4ff528f9ffe60068d22a6c5fdd.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/889af9af1588ef88578e98d56ee62b11.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Rank has no cap! As you delve deeper, enemies become terrifyingly powerful, but the rarity and value of the loot skyrocket to match. New Rune combinations and equipment systems await your discovery at higher tiers. Every strategic choice changes the rhythm of battle, and every breakthrough is a reward for your intellect. Your Build evolves constantly, and your rewards stack infinitely. You will become unstoppable—the ultimate adventurer of the medieval age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/1ceb88db89fec261b98fc2a4e2d9aaa5.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/1ceb88db89fec261b98fc2a4e2d9aaa5.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/1ceb88db89fec261b98fc2a4e2d9aaa5.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/6d8d5ba17ee796fe7b2ddf42ee3b0ffc.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Loot Tycoon is the second game I have developed entirely solo. The game is under active development, with exciting new gameplay modes and mechanics on the roadmap. I sincerely invite you to join the community to share your feedback and creative ideas. Help me make this game even better for everyone. Let’s witness this medieval fantasy world grow and evolve together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/56ac6a485137de4b5ff8a9bf31934cdb.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/56ac6a485137de4b5ff8a9bf31934cdb.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/56ac6a485137de4b5ff8a9bf31934cdb.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Tycoon is a dark fantasy idle RPG that seamlessly blends the thrill of Diablo-style looting with the satisfaction of shop management. While combat and trading are fully automated, your role is far from passive. Every decision you make shapes the unknown surprises of your journey. You must meticulously plan your character's growth and strategize the perfect synergy between your equipment and runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you risk diving deeper into the abyss to hunt for greater treasures, or will you retreat safely to secure your current earnings? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/54af4340b681ee8478d9847697f96775.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/54af4340b681ee8478d9847697f96775.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/54af4340b681ee8478d9847697f96775.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9953f6af1f6d7bc235b84980ed5525c1.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes and Equipment are far more than simple tools of war—they are the very engine of your strategy. Your choice of Runes dictates the flow of combat, while your equipment loadout maximizes your loot efficiency. With hundreds of unique effects and a boundless array of randomized affixes, you have the absolute freedom to engineer thousands of game-breaking builds. Whether you prefer a Berserker style that wipes the entire screen in a single slash, a Pyro-Maniac build that incinerates enemies with critical burns, or a Storm Controller that locks down the battlefield with lightning, every combination reflects your unique signature. Master the art of the kill, control the rhythm of destruction, and experience the perfect fusion of deep strategy and pure adrenaline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9d4b67fc6fa9f2e395045383e23e5603.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9d4b67fc6fa9f2e395045383e23e5603.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/9d4b67fc6fa9f2e395045383e23e5603.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/12bc4fd75c2e8c8085e4d846edf950ac.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a dragon falls, loot rains from the sky like a storm of gold! These massive rewards are the ultimate payoff for your strategy. Every piece of loot you scavenge is a stepping stone to your fortune. Your merchandise is automatically stocked and sold—from common gear to God-tier artifacts. Watch as adventurers flock to your shop, pouring an endless stream of Gold into your pockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hoard your wealth—reinvest it! Spending is the key to growth. Use your earnings to upgrade your stats and equip higher-tier Runes; every coin spent is an investment in your future power. As your Adventure Rank rises, the challenges become deadlier, but the payouts become astronomical. Thrive in the infinite loop of looting and selling, eventually becoming the most powerful adventurer and the wealthiest tycoon in the realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/e3076a4ff528f9ffe60068d22a6c5fdd.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/e3076a4ff528f9ffe60068d22a6c5fdd.webm?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/e3076a4ff528f9ffe60068d22a6c5fdd.mp4?t=1787218926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/889af9af1588ef88578e98d56ee62b11.avif?t=1787218926\" width=780 height=148 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Rank has no cap! As you delve deeper, enemies become terrifyingly powerful, but the rarity and value of the loot skyrocket to match. New Rune combinations and equipment systems await your discovery at higher tiers. Every strategic choice changes the rhythm of battle, and every breakthrough is a reward for your intellect. Your Build evolves constantly, and your rewards stack infinitely. You will become unstoppable—the ultimate adventurer of the medieval age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165310/extras/1ceb88db89fec261b98fc2a4e2d9aaa5.poster.avif?t=1787218926\" width=1170 